title: Traffic to Known TAG-124 Style Traffic Distribution Infrastructure
id: 2d4e5f6a-7b8c-4d1e-9f2a-3b4c5d6e7f08
status: experimental
description: Detects outbound web requests to domains matching TAG-124-style traffic distribution system infrastructure used to redirect victims toward FIN7's fake update or download pages.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.recordedfuture.com/research/grayalpha-uses-diverse-infection-vectors-deploy-powernet-loader-netsupport-rat
tags:
    - attack.command_and_control
    - attack.t1071.001
logsource:
    category: proxy
detection:
    selection:
        c-uri|contains: TAG124_TDS_DOMAIN_LIST  # populate via current threat intel feed at deploy time
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - None expected; verify domain list currency before enabling as high severity
level: medium
